<title>MEXICO: Contal says to invest 200 mln pesos in '97.</title>
<headline>Contal says to invest 200 mln pesos in '97.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican Coca-Cola bottler Grupo Continental (Contal), said on Wednesday it had earmarked 200 million pesos for capital investment in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Approximately 164 million pesos out of this amount will be chanelled into the beverage division and 36 million pesos into sugar mills,&quot; a Contal statement said.</p>
<p>Contal said it intended to fund the investments from in-house cash flow.</p>
<p>((--Daniel Perez, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7617))</p>
